    "title": "Pocket Diver: Fishing Game",
    "description": "At Pocket Diver, you can dive into the ocean and have an close meeting with varities of marine life!\r\nRemember your client's order, that could be a mysterious fish, a beautiful coral, or a shell necklace that made by yourself.\r\nDon't forget to level up and strengthen your skills, you will become strong enough to go to the deeper ocean!\r\nYou'll also have workers, pets and mounts as partners on your adventures. They come in different shapes and have different abilities, but they're all loyal and reliable.Make them your helpers!\r\nDon't hesitate, download now! Play Pocket Diver and enjoy the cool and quiet life at the seaside!",
    "descriptionHTML": "At Pocket Diver, you can dive into the ocean and have an close meeting with varities of marine life!<br>Remember your client&#39;s order, that could be a mysterious fish, a beautiful coral, or a shell necklace that made by yourself.<br>Don&#39;t forget to level up and strengthen your skills, you will become strong enough to go to the deeper ocean!<br>You&#39;ll also have workers, pets and mounts as partners on your adventures. They come in different shapes and have different abilities, but they&#39;re all loyal and reliable.Make them your helpers!<br>Don&#39;t hesitate, download now! Play Pocket Diver and enjoy the cool and quiet life at the seaside!",
